## PMO / Crown Copyright (DE&I)

- Synthetic delivery figures only; DEPP 2025 for programme **shape**
- OIA-2025-5483 reference PDFs are public/unclassified — **not** an NZSIS breach to cite
- Always caption: *Sourced from publicly available Official Information Act (OIA) release OIA-2025-5483. © Crown Copyright.*
- Never use NZDF logos / government emblems as endorsement
- Keep Streamlit OIA captions in `dei-pmo-dashboard/app.py` (header + sidebar)
